          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நம்பிக்கை (nambikkai) — \"trust\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Trust, and the confidence that comes with it. All three are off the same old stem: Kannada ನಂಬಿಕೆ (nambike), Telugu నమ్మకం (nammakaṁ), Tamil நம்பிக்கை (nambikkai)."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A விருந்தாளி is given this before anything else is given, which is the whole of what a Tamil house means by hospitality."
            }
          ]
        },
